Subject: [PATCH] test(core): Add tests for fork patch 0015 (red first)

- Add 41 tests under `sdk/packages/core/src/extensions/tools/`. Change no source files.
- Target run_commands, the model command tool, and its 30 seconds limit. A 45 second command stopped at 29.85 seconds.
- Add 11 resolver and stderr reporter tests in `shell-timeout.test.ts`.
- Add 21 fake-timer tests in `builtin-shell-timeout.test.ts` for shared limits and descriptions.
- Add 6 real shell executor tests in `builtin-shell-executor-timeout.test.ts`.
- Add 3 timer cleanup tests in `with-timeout.test.ts`.
- Without changes, 3 files cannot load. In `with-timeout.test.ts`, 2 of the 3 tests fail.
- With the 30000 stub, all four files load. Of 41 tests, 33 fail on assertion and 8 pass.
